  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/KeyComputerScience/DA-AHE/zipball/independent-evidence-2026-10-15",
  "body": "Complete raw evidence from the independent DA-AHE implementation: 20 paired seeds (1000\u20131019), 7 methods, 140 runs, 3000 nodes and 60 gateways. This release preserves the original archive bytes, per-run trajectories, exogenous inputs, frozen source/configuration, security-estimator logs, decoding records and build/test receipts.\r\n\r\nDownload all four .part files and asset-index.json. Concatenate the parts in numeric order to restore DA-AHE-independent-evidence.tar. Whole archive: 3,027,425,280 bytes; SHA-256: 079aa14358b83d5cf6e132b2c4b653ac2937feeae217c6c6965e1369cff511c0. Each part is also hash-checked by the repository verification helper.\r\n\r\nThese are newly executed independent experiments, not recovered original-author artifacts. The selected k=6 security tuple differs from the manuscript k=3 tuple. Physical-board samples remain zero; no board timing, measured stack or energy results are claimed. Archive hashes establish byte integrity, not authenticity of physical measurements or a full cryptographic proof. Full manuscript reproduction and all manuscript metrics remain unverified.\r\n\r\nSee docs/PUBLIC_EVIDENCE.md and docs/REPRODUCTION_COVERAGE.md in the repository for verification instructions and scope."
